        {
          "text": " Ku baahikireyo, Yeshua mwene Yozadaaki yaimuka na beene ishe abanyamurwa, na Zerubabeeli mwene Shealutieli na beene waabo, baayombeka eitambiro rya Ruhanga wa Israeli kutambiraho ebitambo by'okwotsya, nk'oku kihandiikirwe omu biragiro bya Musa omushaija wa Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
