              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha izooba ry'okubanza ery'okwezi kwa mushanju niho baatandiikire kutambira MUKAMA ebitambo by'okwotsya. Kwonka omusingi gwa hekalu ya MUKAMA gukaba gutakatairweho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
