        {
          "text": " N'ahabw'ekyo baaha abombeki n'ababaizi empiiha, kandi baaha Abasidoni n'Abatuuro eby'okurya n'eby'okunywa n'amajuta, ngu bareete emiti y'emyerezi, kugiiha Lebanooni bakagireeta aha nyanja, bakagihitsya Yoopa, nk'oku Kuuro omugabe wa Perisi yaabaikiriize.",
