        },
        {
          "text": " Omu mwaka gwa kabiri baherize kuhika aha nju ya Ruhaga omuri Yerusaalemu, omu kwezi kwa kabiri, nibwo Zerubabeeli mwene Shealutieli na Yeshua mwene Yozadaaki baatandika kwombeka, nibakwatanisa na beene waabo abandi, abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi n'abaarugire omu bukwatwa boona, bakaija Yerusaalemu. Baataho Abaleevi abaine emyaka makumi abiri n'okukiraho okureeberera omurimo gw'enju ya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
