          "text": " Abomeki ku baataireho omusingi gwa hekalu ya MUKAMA, abanyamurwa baija bajwaire ebijwaro byabo baine amakondere, n'Abaleevi beene Asafu baija n'ebitaasa, kuhimbisa MUKAMA, nk'oku Daudi omugabe wa Israeli yaaragiire, ",
